{#-
  Renders the `## Lessons` section for both playbook render surfaces.

  lessons   — list[booping.context.lesson.Lesson]; empty renders nothing
  step_mode — True for the `--step` surface: step-scoped wording, no scope line

  Lesson bodies are inserted as variables, never parsed as Jinja.
-#}
{%- if lessons -%}
## Lessons

The following {{ lessons | length }} lesson(s) apply to this {% if step_mode %}step{% else %}playbook{% endif %}. Never silently violate one{% if not step_mode %}; conflict → stop and flag{% endif %}.
{% for lesson in lessons %}
### {{ lesson.id }} — {{ lesson.title }}
{% if not step_mode %}*(scope: {{ lesson.scope }})*
{% endif %}
{{ lesson.body.rstrip() }}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}
